msgstr "所有速度都按 %(working)s 個 token 的上下文計算，這樣每一列才可比；上下文欄給出的是每個候選能容納的最大長度。按 %(use_case)s、%(requested)s 個 token 估算大小並評分。"

msgid "Speeds are for %(working)s tokens of context so every row compares like with like; the context column is the largest each one holds. Sized for %(planned)s tokens and scored for %(use_case)s against %(requested)s."
msgstr "所有速度都按 %(working)s 個 token 的上下文計算，這樣每一列才可比；上下文欄給出的是每個候選能容納的最大長度。按 %(planned)s 個 token 估算大小，並按 %(use_case)s 對照 %(requested)s 評分。"

